		"description": {
			"public": "<p><strong>Legendary Leather Armor</strong> &middot; <strong>Price:</strong> 1,800,000 g</p><p><em>Tales of Gravestalkers can be found in all corners of the world, their blackened garb a portent of doom.</em></p><hr><p><strong>6+DEX+WIL Armor</strong> (Req. 1 STR).</p><p><strong>Soul Absorption.</strong> (1/encounter) On kill: You may absorb the soul of your victim to become empowered for 3 turns. While empowered, your attacks deal Necrotic damage, ignore Armor and heal you for 10 HP on crit or kill.</p><p class=\"nim-plus-credit\"><em>&mdash; Santuric & SanityWithIn, Nim+ Volume IV</em></p>",
